{"id":"stamm","lemma":"Stamm","pos":"noun","rank":3428,"glosses":["tree trunk, main stem of a plant (but never used of thin stalks or twigs)","tribe","stem (of a word)"],"ipa":"/ʃtam/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/24/De-Stamm.ogg/De-Stamm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Stammes","plural":"Stämme"},"formAudio":{"Stämme":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-St%C3%A4mme.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Stamm sammelte Beeren.","en":"The tribe foraged for berries.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to gather","l":"sammeln"},{"g":"berry","l":"Beere"}]},{"text":"Der Apfel fällt nicht weit vom Stamm.","en":"Like father, like son.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"apple"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"wide"},{"g":"from the"},null]},{"text":"Er ist seit 35 Jahren der Häuptling seines Stammes.","en":"He has been the chief of his tribe for 35 years.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"chief"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Es gibt immer noch einige wilde Stämme auf dieser Insel.","en":"There are still some savage tribes on that island.","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"wild","l":"wild"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"an island, an isle"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"there is, there are"],[2,4,"still"]]},{"text":"Der Stamm verehrt die Ahnen.","en":"That tribe worships its ancestors.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to revere, to venerate","l":"verehren"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"to suspect, guess"}]}]}